OL,3,AHamas political official and wife among
OL,4,Aeight Palestinians killed in Israeli
OL,5,Astrikes on Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Hamas political official and his wife
OL,8,Fwere among eight Palestinians killed in
OL,9,Fthree Israeli air strikes across the
OL,10,FGaza Strip on Thursday.
OL,12,FLocal sources told the BBC a
OL,13,Fresidential apartment in Deir al-Balah
OL,14,Fwas targeted at dawn, killing Khaled
OL,15,FAbu Nada - the deputy education
OL,16,Fminister - and his wife, Abeer Mohammed
OL,17,FIsmail Abu Nada.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
