OL,3,AHamas political official and wife among
OL,4,Aeight Palestinians killed in Israeli
OL,5,Astrikes on Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Hamas Civil Defence spokesman said
OL,8,Fthat rescue teams and medical personnel
OL,9,Fhad transferred eight bodies to Al-Aqsa
OL,10,FHospital in central Gaza and Al-Shifa
OL,11,FHospital in Gaza City.
OL,13,FIn a joint statement, Israel's prime
OL,14,Fminister and defence minister said the
OL,15,Foperation was "part of a series of
OL,16,Ftargeted killings" against Hamas
OL,17,Fofficials.
